{"hw":"ἀδείμαντος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀδείμαντος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀδείμαντος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">δειμαίνω</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">fearless, dauntless</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">N.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.17</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἦλθ' ἀ. ποδί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">697</span> </span>: c. gen., <span class=\"gk\">ἐμαυτῆς ἀ.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">without fear for</b> myself, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pers.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">162</span> </span>. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-τως</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ch.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">771</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">where no fear is</b>, <span class=\"gk\">οἰκία</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Luc.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Philops.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">31</span> </span>.</div></div>"}